        "code": {
          "text": "Eye, ear, throat, and neck examination"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Conjunctivae clear; tympanic membranes normal bilaterally. Mild diffuse pharyngeal erythema; no exudate or tonsillar swelling; uvula midline; no trismus. Neck supple with no cervical lymphadenopathy."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-16",
