          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Localized tenderness to palpation at the medial calcaneal tuberosity and proximal plantar fascia, especially the anteromedial aspect. No swelling, warmth, or erythema. Achilles tendon non-tender. Arches mildly reduced, consistent with pes planus. Foot neurovascular examination normal."
      }
